# A brand rides the ENEMY, as GMS's does: every Blast that strikes one brands
# it, and the fifth brand detonates on that enemy alone. So a boss with several
# bodies is worth several detonations, and a monster that dies at four brands
# is worth none -- which is the reading a passive for bossing wants.
#
# The detonation REPLACES that enemy's share of the fifth Blast rather than
# following it. Worth eighteen Blasts, so the one it costs is barely visible.
#
# Its 20% ignored defence is the point of the skill. It rides the swing alone,
# which is what an ied_pct on an attack means -- see WithoutSwingLevers.
name: "Divine Judgment"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "Marks enemies struck by Blast with a Divine Brand. At full stacks the brand "
  "detonates, dealing damage that ignores some of the enemy's Defense."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PALADIN
max_level: 30
exceeds_master_level: true
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Blast"
  level: 5
}
boosts_skill_name: "Blast"
empowered_form {
  casts_per_trigger: 5
  counts_per_enemy: true
  lines: 10
  base {
    skill_pct: 4.34
    ied_pct: 0.20
  }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
}
